// Rules of the game that a PR adds switched off. A rule that changes every country's numbers
// enters here off, so that the main keeps its hash; switching it on is a PR of its own, judged
// by the world's aggregates (owner's decision of 2026-11-17, `docs/architecture.pt-BR.md`).
// `bf-bench --rule NAME` switches one on for a run.
(
    // Schooling by cohort and level, and the adult literacy campaign
    // (`docs/population.pt-BR.md`, "Ensino por coorte"). Off: literacy follows the economy's
    // yearly rule and mothers' schooling the 240-month lag.
    schooling: false,
)
